Device was on v2.3.0 at this point (from an earlier successful slow-server upgrade test).
ota check -> current v2.3.0, stable v2.1.0, beta v2.3.0, running newer than stable.
ota server http://172.20.10.12:8000/fw7/
ota install 2.1.0 force
