  [OTA] 10%
  [OTA] 20%
  <-- tester turned the iPhone's Personal Hotspot OFF for a few seconds here, then back ON -->
  wifi:bcn_timeout,ap_probe_send_start
  wifi:ap_probe_send over, reset wifi status to disassoc
  W110 wifi connection lost (reason 200)
  transport_base: tcp_read error, errno=Software caused connection abort
  [LINK] retry 1/3...
  E410 download interrupted (ESP_FAIL)
  wifi: reconnected automatically ('user — iPhone', got ip 172.20.10.13 again)
  [TELEMETRY] resumed normally; transient "WARN no internet" + [CIC #1 WARNING] right after reconnect
  (expected: internet check had not completed yet at that instant)
version after: 2.3.0 (unchanged, downgrade correctly aborted).
ota check (recovery check) -> responds normally: current v2.3.0, stable v2.1.0, beta v2.3.0, running newer
