TC-OTA-16: PASS. TC-OTA-21 (device works + next OTA check succeeds after an error): PASS.

Bonus: an earlier attempt with the local server NOT running gave:
  E (68890) esp-tls: [sock=54] delayed connect error: Connection reset by peer
  E (68890) sentry: E402 cannot reach OTA server (HTTP -1)
Correct behavior for an unreachable server - bonus confirmation of TC-OTA-23 (E402).

Note: 'ota install 2.1.0 force' sent once while a background [TELEMETRY #8] line was interleaving with the
typed command gave E400 usage: ota install <X.Y.Z> [force] - a harmless console-interleaving artifact (stray
characters merged into the command), not a bug; the retyped command worked normally.

